---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="SiteGov: Website Infrastructure Tracking for Agencies"
  description="Know who controls every provider behind every client site. SiteGov maps the registrar, DNS, hosting, email, and SSL behind every client domain."
  ogTitle="SiteGov: Go-live day. DNS needs to update. Nobody can log in."
  ogDescription="Website infrastructure tracking for agencies. Map providers, document ownership, and make sure your team always has the access they need, before the moment they need it."
>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-slate-950 text-white">

    <!-- Atmosphere backdrop -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none select-none" aria-hidden="true">
      <!-- 32px dot grid at 8% opacity -->
      <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(148,163,184,0.35) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 32px 32px; opacity: 0.08;"></div>
      <!-- Topology node-link graph -->
      <svg class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full opacity-[0.07]" viewBox="0 0 1400 600" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice">
        <!-- Scatter dots -->
        <circle cx="60" cy="80" r="1.5" fill="#94a3b8"/><circle cx="180" cy="48" r="1" fill="#94a3b8"/>
        <circle cx="340" cy="30" r="1.5" fill="#94a3b8"/><circle cx="460" cy="72" r="1" fill="#94a3b8"/>
        <circle cx="700" cy="42" r="1.5" fill="#94a3b8"/><circle cx="900" cy="62" r="1" fill="#94a3b8"/>
        <circle cx="1100" cy="28" r="1.5" fill="#94a3b8"/><circle cx="1280" cy="76" r="1" fill="#94a3b8"/>
        <circle cx="1350" cy="180" r="1.5" fill="#94a3b8"/><circle cx="1320" cy="380" r="1" fill="#94a3b8"/>
        <circle cx="1180" cy="500" r="1.5" fill="#94a3b8"/><circle cx="1050" cy="558" r="1" fill="#94a3b8"/>
        <circle cx="780" cy="570" r="1.5" fill="#94a3b8"/><circle cx="500" cy="560" r="1" fill="#94a3b8"/>
        <circle cx="70" cy="480" r="1.5" fill="#94a3b8"/><circle cx="480" cy="260" r="1" fill="#94a3b8"/>
        <circle cx="1000" cy="302" r="1.5" fill="#94a3b8"/><circle cx="750" cy="488" r="1" fill="#94a3b8"/>
        <circle cx="1150" cy="352" r="1.5" fill="#94a3b8"/><circle cx="330" cy="472" r="1" fill="#94a3b8"/>
        <!-- Edges -->
        <line x1="120" y1="220" x2="380" y2="150" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="0.75"/>
        <line x1="380" y1="150" x2="620" y2="100" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="0.75"/>
        <line x1="380" y1="150" x2="250" y2="380" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="0.75"/>
        <line x1="620" y1="100" x2="820" y2="230" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="0.75"/>
        <line x1="620" y1="100" x2="560" y2="400" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="0.75"/>
        <line x1="820" y1="230" x2="950" y2="430" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="0.75"/>
        <line x1="560" y1="400" x2="950" y2="430" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="0.75"/>
        <line x1="250" y1="380" x2="150" y2="520" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="0.75"/>
        <line x1="820" y1="230" x2="1150" y2="350" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="0.75" stroke-dasharray="4 3"/>
        <!-- Nodes -->
        <circle cx="120" cy="220" r="4.5" fill="#94a3b8"/>
        <circle cx="380" cy="150" r="4.5" fill="#94a3b8"/>
        <circle cx="250" cy="380" r="4.5" fill="#94a3b8"/>
        <circle cx="620" cy="100" r="4.5" fill="#94a3b8"/>
        <circle cx="820" cy="230" r="4.5" fill="#94a3b8"/>
        <circle cx="560" cy="400" r="4.5" fill="#94a3b8"/>
        <circle cx="950" cy="430" r="4.5" fill="#94a3b8"/>
        <circle cx="150" cy="520" r="3.5" fill="#94a3b8"/>
        <circle cx="1150" cy="350" r="3" fill="#94a3b8"/>
        <!-- Node labels -->
        <text x="120" y="204" text-anchor="middle" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="9" font-family="monospace" letter-spacing="1">REGISTRAR</text>
        <text x="380" y="134" text-anchor="middle" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="9" font-family="monospace" letter-spacing="1">DNS</text>
        <text x="250" y="364" text-anchor="middle" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="9" font-family="monospace" letter-spacing="1">NAMESERVERS</text>
        <text x="620" y="84" text-anchor="middle" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="9" font-family="monospace" letter-spacing="1">HOSTING</text>
        <text x="820" y="214" text-anchor="middle" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="9" font-family="monospace" letter-spacing="1">CDN</text>
        <text x="560" y="384" text-anchor="middle" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="9" font-family="monospace" letter-spacing="1">SSL</text>
        <text x="950" y="414" text-anchor="middle" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="9" font-family="monospace" letter-spacing="1">EMAIL</text>
        <text x="150" y="504" text-anchor="middle" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="9" font-family="monospace" letter-spacing="1">ANALYTICS</text>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <!-- Amber hairline divider -->
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-amber-500/25 to-transparent"></div>

    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 pt-24 pb-20">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
        <div>
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-teal-900/50 border border-teal-700/50 text-teal-300 text-xs font-medium mb-8">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-400 inline-block"></span>
            For agencies and digital service providers
          </div>
          <h1 class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight mb-6">
            Go-live day. DNS needs to update. Nobody can log in to the registrar.
          </h1>
          <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-3">
            Know who controls every provider behind every client site.
          </p>
          <p class="text-base text-slate-500 leading-relaxed mb-10">
            SiteGov maps the registrar, DNS, hosting, email, and SSL behind every domain. Your team records who controls each one. Whether it&rsquo;s go-live day, a migration, or a renewal, you&rsquo;ve already got the answer.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
            <a href="/signup" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3.5 bg-white text-slate-900 text-sm font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors">
              Run a free infrastructure scan
            </a>
            <a href="#solution" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3.5 bg-transparent text-slate-300 text-sm font-medium rounded-lg border border-slate-700 hover:border-slate-500 hover:text-white transition-colors">
              See how it works
            </a>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-slate-600">No credit card required. Your first scan in under five minutes.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Product visual -->
        <div class="hidden md:block">
          <!-- Artifact frame -->
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2 px-0.5">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-600 uppercase tracking-widest">REC·0481-A</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-600">17:42:08 UTC</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-900 p-5 shadow-2xl frame-amber">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4 pb-4 border-b border-slate-800">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-white text-sm font-semibold font-mono">christophercross.com</span>
                <span class="inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-medium bg-red-900/60 text-red-300">High Risk</span>
              </div>
              <span class="text-slate-500 text-xs font-medium">DACS 34 / 100</span>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-0 mb-4">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between py-2.5 border-b border-slate-800">
                <span class="text-slate-500 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">Registrar</span>
                <span class="text-slate-200 text-xs font-medium">GoDaddy</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between py-2.5 border-b border-slate-800">
                <span class="text-slate-500 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">DNS</span>
                <span class="text-slate-200 text-xs font-medium">Cloudflare</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between py-2.5 border-b border-slate-800">
                <span class="text-slate-500 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">Hosting</span>
                <span class="text-slate-200 text-xs font-medium">WP Engine</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between py-2.5 border-b border-slate-800">
                <span class="text-slate-500 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">SSL</span>
                <span class="text-amber-400 text-xs font-medium">Expires in 14 days</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between py-2.5">
                <span class="text-slate-500 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">Email</span>
                <span class="text-slate-200 text-xs font-medium">Google Workspace</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-2">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 bg-slate-950 rounded-lg px-3 py-2.5">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-red-500 shrink-0"></span>
                <span class="text-slate-300 text-xs">Former employee listed as DNS admin</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 bg-slate-950 rounded-lg px-3 py-2.5">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500 shrink-0"></span>
                <span class="text-slate-300 text-xs">No backup admin documented</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 bg-slate-950 rounded-lg px-3 py-2.5">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500 shrink-0"></span>
                <span class="text-slate-300 text-xs">MFA status not verified on registrar</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Problem -->
  <section class="border-b border-slate-100 bg-slate-50 py-20 paper-grain">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mb-14">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400 mb-4">The client owns the domain. Your team owns the emergency.</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold leading-tight text-slate-900">Projects don&rsquo;t stall because of missing code. They stall because of missing ownership.</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-500 text-lg leading-relaxed mt-4">Before a project goes live, someone needs access to DNS. Before a domain renews, someone needs to own the registrar account. Before a site migrates, someone needs to know which provider controls the hosting, and who the login belongs to. When that information is missing, everything stops. None of it was hidden. It was all discoverable on day one. Nobody looked.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Custody line (desktop) -->
      <div class="hidden md:block mb-5 relative px-[calc(16.67%-8px)]">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 900 28" class="w-full h-7" aria-hidden="true">
          <line x1="0" y1="14" x2="300" y2="14" stroke="#1e293b" stroke-width="1"/>
          <line x1="300" y1="14" x2="600" y2="14" stroke="#1e293b" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3 3"/>
          <line x1="600" y1="14" x2="900" y2="14" stroke="#1e293b" stroke-width="1"/>
          <circle cx="150" cy="14" r="4" fill="#1e293b"/>
          <circle cx="450" cy="14" r="4" fill="white" stroke="#1e293b" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <circle cx="750" cy="14" r="4" fill="#1e293b"/>
          <text x="150" y="7" text-anchor="middle" font-family="IBM Plex Mono" font-size="8" fill="#94a3b8" letter-spacing="1">2019</text>
          <text x="450" y="7" text-anchor="middle" font-family="IBM Plex Mono" font-size="8" fill="#94a3b8" letter-spacing="1">— GAP —</text>
          <text x="750" y="7" text-anchor="middle" font-family="IBM Plex Mono" font-size="8" fill="#94a3b8" letter-spacing="1">2024</text>
        </svg>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">

        <div class="bg-white p-6 frame-teal">
          <!-- Dossier header -->
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4 pb-3 border-b border-dashed border-slate-200">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest">CASE · A-014</span>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-500">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500 shrink-0"></span>HIGH
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-slate-900 text-white text-[11px] font-mono flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">AL</div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-slate-800 text-sm font-semibold leading-none mb-0.5">Access blockers at launch</p>
              <p class="text-slate-400 text-[10px] font-mono">Registrar &middot; DNS unknown</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-400/60 to-transparent mb-4"></div>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">The site is built. The client is ready. The DNS is still managed by an agency that stopped returning emails six months ago. The registrar login went to someone&rsquo;s personal Gmail. The project is not going live today. This was all visible before the project started.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-6 frame-teal">
          <!-- Dossier header -->
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4 pb-3 border-b border-dashed border-slate-200">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest">CASE · A-015</span>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-500">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-500 shrink-0"></span>CRITICAL
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-slate-900 text-white text-[11px] font-mono flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">KR</div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-slate-800 text-sm font-semibold leading-none mb-0.5">Hidden ownership risk</p>
              <p class="text-slate-400 text-[10px] font-mono">Former employee &middot; admin</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-red-400/60 to-transparent mb-4"></div>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">A critical provider account belongs to someone who left eighteen months ago. Nobody documented a backup admin. Nobody actually knows if MFA is enabled. Everything is fine. Right up until it isn&rsquo;t. It was there on day one. Nobody documented it.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-6 frame-teal">
          <!-- Dossier header -->
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4 pb-3 border-b border-dashed border-slate-200">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest">CASE · A-016</span>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-500">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500 shrink-0"></span>HIGH
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-slate-900 text-white text-[11px] font-mono flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">HF</div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-slate-800 text-sm font-semibold leading-none mb-0.5">Handoff failures</p>
              <p class="text-slate-400 text-[10px] font-mono">Chain of custody &middot; partial</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-400/60 to-transparent mb-4"></div>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">A client switches agencies. The incoming team inherits a tangle of accounts, personal logins, and extremely confident guesses. The outgoing agency is pretty sure the domain is in a GoDaddy account. Probably. What should take a day takes three weeks.</p>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ✏ DRAFT REVIEW: Go-live moments section. Decide: keep on homepage here, or use-cases page only? Delete callout once placed. -->
  <section class="py-20 border-b border-slate-100 paper-grain">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mb-10">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400 mb-4">The highest-cost moment</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold leading-tight">When the project needs to go live, the information is already there &mdash; or it isn&rsquo;t.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
        <!-- STATE · 01 — Kickoff: all green -->
        <div class="bg-white p-6 frame-teal">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3 pb-3 border-b border-dashed border-slate-200">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest">STATE · 01</span>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-500">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-500 shrink-0"></span>READY
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400 flex items-center gap-1"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-500 inline-block"></span>REG</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400 flex items-center gap-1"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-500 inline-block"></span>DNS</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400 flex items-center gap-1"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-500 inline-block"></span>HOST</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400 flex items-center gap-1"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-500 inline-block"></span>SSL</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400 mb-3">Kickoff</p>
          <p class="text-slate-900 text-sm font-semibold mb-3">Start the project knowing what you&rsquo;re working with.</p>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">Without SiteGov, discovery happens mid-project. Who registered the domain, who controls DNS, who holds the registrar login &mdash; all of it surfaces after the timeline is already set.</p>
          <p class="text-teal-700 text-xs font-medium">With SiteGov: scan on day one, complete infrastructure map before the first meeting.</p>
        </div>
        <!-- STATE · 02 — Migration: DNS amber -->
        <div class="bg-white p-6 frame-teal">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3 pb-3 border-b border-dashed border-slate-200">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest">STATE · 02</span>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-500">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500 shrink-0"></span>MID-FLIGHT
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400 flex items-center gap-1"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-500 inline-block"></span>REG</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400 flex items-center gap-1"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500 inline-block"></span>DNS</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400 flex items-center gap-1"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-500 inline-block"></span>HOST</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400 flex items-center gap-1"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-500 inline-block"></span>SSL</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400 mb-3">Migration</p>
          <p class="text-slate-900 text-sm font-semibold mb-3">Move the site without a last-minute search party.</p>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">Without SiteGov, hosting and DNS details are scattered across old emails. Moving platforms means discovering mid-project who has the login and whether it still works.</p>
          <p class="text-teal-700 text-xs font-medium">With SiteGov: every provider is already documented before the project starts.</p>
        </div>
        <!-- STATE · 03 — Go-live: DNS + HOST red, SSL amber -->
        <div class="bg-white p-6 frame-teal">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3 pb-3 border-b border-dashed border-slate-200">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest">STATE · 03</span>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-500">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-500 shrink-0"></span>STUCK
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400 flex items-center gap-1"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-500 inline-block"></span>REG</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400 flex items-center gap-1"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-500 inline-block"></span>DNS</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400 flex items-center gap-1"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-500 inline-block"></span>HOST</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400 flex items-center gap-1"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500 inline-block"></span>SSL</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400 mb-3">Go-live day</p>
          <p class="text-slate-900 text-sm font-semibold mb-3">The cutover window is open. You already have what you need.</p>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">Without SiteGov, go-live day is when you find out the DNS is still controlled by a previous agency. The cutover window closes. The project doesn&rsquo;t ship today.</p>
          <p class="text-teal-700 text-xs font-medium">With SiteGov: credentials are documented, the admin is identified, the path is already clear.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Solution -->
  <section id="solution" class="py-24 bg-slate-950 text-white">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-start">
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-500 mb-4">From emergency response to operational control.</p>
          <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold leading-tight mb-6 text-white">
            A clear record of who controls what, across every client site.
          </h2>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4">
